Well, yeah.

532
00:20:09.780 --> 00:20:11.240
Well, I will tell you this.

533
00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:17.760
I was working years ago at a company and they had parking for us in the building and then

534
00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:21.420
it was bought out by another company and they got rid of our parking.

535
00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:22.500
Same thing.

536
